      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Warwick's basic attacks deal bonus magic damage. If Warwick is below 50% health, he heals the same amount. If Warwick is below 25% health, this healing triples.",
      "summary_zh": "沃里克的普攻造成额外魔法伤害。如果沃里克的生命值低于50%，那么他会获得等额的治疗效果。如果他的生命值低于25%，则治疗效果提升至三倍。",
